n prison or out of prison and  it's not really a reason to say a group  shouldn't be allowed to vote but here's  the more important thing if you believe  that the prison population is so big  that allowing prisoners to vote could  result in electing someone who will  straight up let them out of prison the  reaction shouldn't be they shouldn't be  a  to vote the reaction should be we have  way too many people in prison if the  population is so big that merely  allowing prisoners to vote could change  the results of elections in such a way  that someone promising if you vote for  me I'll let you out of prison could  actually be a playable strategy for  winning an election good for Bernie  Sanders not allowing himself to be  pulled into these irrelevant debates and  what about the Boston bomber voting the  right to vote is binary and I believe  that people in prison should have the  right to vote now I want to hear from  you about what you think you can vote  about this issue at youtube.com slash  the david pakman show slash community  and on tomorrow's show we'll have the  results from our audience in the  meantime let me know your thoughts I'm  on Twitter at D Pakman and the show is  on Twitter at David Pakman show support  those who support the David Pakman show  and today that includes our good friends  over at BR D Bitcoin wallet these guys  are awesome and the BR D Bitcoin wallet  is absolutely perfect for anybody who's  getting into Bitcoin or cryptocurrency  for the first time because it was  designed with simplicity and ease of use  in mind but you'll also love it if you  have experience with Bitcoin it's an  all-in-one app for iOS and Android that  lets you buy Bitcoin and other  cryptocurrencies using your credit card  lets you store everything on the app for  free you can trade and sell  cryptocurrency within the app and when  you use BRD wallet you're the only  person who has access to your Bitcoin  BRD doesn't store any of your personal  information you don't even have nor do  you need a username and password on the  platform it's all within an environment  that's virtually impossible to hack so  your cryptocurrency is safe extremely  easy to use  it's how I store my own Bitcoin I think  you'll be impressed with it too it's the  first-ever Bitcoin wallet in the iOS App  Store and now they have over 2 million  users for more than 170 countries BR DS  mission is to make buying selling and  storing Bitcoin and other  cryptocurrencies sim  more efficient and more secure and  they've done an awesome job check out my  interview with Aaron from the BRD team  we had a really interesting discussion  about the state of cryptocurrency going  forward you can also download the BRD  app for ios and android i've put a link  right underneath this video
 

